I heard a telephone tone , and it felt green because it sounded just like the color green .
The BBC beeps , they sound turquoise , and listening to Mozart became a yellow experience , so I started to paint music and paint people &apos;s voices , because people &apos;s voices have frequencies that I relate to color .
