Ten variations . This is , like , spin the letter around .
( Typing noises ) This is , like , a ring of letters . ( Typing noises ) This is 20 years old , so it &apos;s kind of a — Let &apos;s see , this is — I love the French film &quot; &quot; The Red Balloon . &quot; &quot; Great movie , right ? I love that movie . So , this is sort of like a play on that . ( Typing noises ) ( Typewriter bell ) It &apos;s peaceful , like that . ( Laughter ) I &apos;ll show this last one . This is about balance , you know .
It &apos;s kind of stressful typing out , so if you type on this keyboard , you can , like , balance it out .
( Laughter ) If you hit G , life &apos;s okay , so I always say , &quot; &quot; Hit G , and it &apos;s going to be all right .
