So there &apos;s so much from this .
I mean , first of all , some people may just be profoundly depressed at the thought that , if evolution does not favor reality , I mean , doesn &apos;t that to some extent undermine all our endeavors here , all our ability to think that we can think the truth , possibly even including your own theory , if you go there ?
Donald Hoffman : Well , this does not stop us from a successful science .
